# Data layer

- Schema versions live only in `src/db/schema.ts`. Current: v4 (multi-map booth index).
- Booths: prefer `floorMapId`; lookups use `[eventId+floorMapId+boothKey]` when scoped.
- Active event: `localStorage` `cfn-active-event`. Active map: `cfn-active-map:<eventId>`.
- Helpers: `createEvent`, `deleteEventCascade`, `resolveActiveFloorMapId`, `setActiveFloorMapId`.
- `saveFloorMapBlob` modes: `replace-active` | `add` | `replace-all` (sample uses replace-all).
- Backup format `cfn-backup` **v2** (`floorMaps[]` + booth `mapKey`); still parse v1.
- Custom tags: `registerCustomTag(s)` / `mergeTagCatalog` in `src/lib/tags.ts` — not Dexie.
- Auto-seed Otakon sample only when `events.count() === 1` (first-run).
